<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="scroll-smooth" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-surface text-on-surface">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main>
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <section
        class="relative pt-24 pb-32 overflow-hidden px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop"
      >
        <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"></div>
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto relative z-10">
          <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <h1
              class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary mb-6 leading-tight"
            >
              Redefining trust in the global rental ecosystem.
            </h1>
            <p
              class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-secondary mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl"
            >
              HomiFund was built on a simple premise: that the relationship
              between landlord and tenant should be rooted in verified
              accountability, not administrative friction.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary-container px-4 py-2 rounded-full"
              >
                <span
                  class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                  style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1"
                  >verified</span
                >
                <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary"
                  >Tenant &amp; Landlord Verification</span
                >
              </div>
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary-container px-4 py-2 rounded-full"
              >
                <span
                  class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                  style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1"
                  >security</span
                >
                <span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary"
                  >Secure Property Matching</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Our Story (Bento Grid Style) -->
      <section
        class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop"
      >
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter-desktop">
            <div class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center">
              <span
                class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase tracking-widest mb-4"
                >Our Origin</span
              >
              <h2
                class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-6"
              >
                Born from the friction of modern property markets.
              </h2>
              <div
                class="space-y-4 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant"
              >
                <p class="">
                  Renting should not feel like a gamble. Landlords should know
                  who they are renting to, and tenants should know who they are
                  renting from. HomiFund was created to transform the rental
                  experience through verification, HomiScore, reputation, and
                  accountability.<br /><br />By giving both landlords and
                  tenants a trusted identity within the ecosystem, we create a
                  fairer and more transparent marketplace where good behaviour
                  is rewarded, trust is visible, and stronger rental
                  relationships become the norm rather than the exception.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-5">
              <div
                class="relative h-[260px] sm:h-[360px] lg:h-[480px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-outline-variant"
              >
                <img
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
                  data-alt="A professional architectural photograph of a modern, glass-walled office building at dusk. The lighting is warm and inviting, casting a glow on the clean, geometric lines of the structure. The scene evokes a sense of corporate stability, reliability, and modern PropTech innovation. High-end, minimalist aesthetic with deep blue and soft gray tones."
                  src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuD2I-8AHd__AlQMvbLOA3wjYLylOfwFJzyEi_rARqv4gu36yHsiiHi7YEDoe1kFUd_DJtUk_kBEEX2tmC3wYG5TLBxwPJJweviWRT_5IzVfiLlXy6evGMEuyCt2QbGedUlF0NwnOjw0sJzyjQ2nuzE3cA6ft7SsibeLhVaeCULkEsncjCakm889pHMwZzdt3FVmFEb1B_TnTjoSm3IC83wmHWwcpa3lNEgYGNxuwbYviH1j5fIxTwemaVBjWdMztXj7NAPDbNUPaseE"
                />
                <div
                  class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/40 to-transparent"
                ></div>
                <div
                  class="absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8 glass-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/20"
                >
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
                    <div
                      class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                    >
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary"
                        >history_edu</span
                      >
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <div
                        class="font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-primary"
                      >
                        Renting shouldn't be a gamble.
                      </div>
                      <div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary">
                        We're here to make it a sure thing.
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Core Values (Icon Grid) -->
      <section class="py-24 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-4">
              Principles that drive us.
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary">
              Every feature we build and every score we calculate is governed by
              four foundational pillars.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter-desktop"
          >
            <!-- Transparency -->
            <div
              class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all duration-300 group bg-surface-container-lowest"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                  >visibility</span
                >
              </div>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-[20px] font-bold text-primary mb-3"
              >
                Transparency
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                No hidden metrics. Both parties see exactly how scores are
                calculated and what data drives the outcome.
              </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Accountability -->
            <div
              class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all duration-300 group bg-surface-container-lowest"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">rule</span>
              </div>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-[20px] font-bold text-primary mb-3"
              >
                Accountability
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                Positive actions yield positive results. We reward reliability
                through lower deposits and better terms.
              </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Security -->
            <div
              class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all duration-300 group bg-surface-container-lowest"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span
                  class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary"
                  style="font-variation-settings: &quot;FILL&quot; 1"
                  >lock</span
                >
              </div>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-[20px] font-bold text-primary mb-3"
              >
                Security
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                Data-driven verification ensures that sensitive personal
                information is protected and only shared with explicit consent.
              </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Community -->
            <div
              class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-all duration-300 group bg-surface-container-lowest"
            >
              <div
                class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">hub</span>
              </div>
              <h3
                class="font-headline-md text-[20px] font-bold text-primary mb-3"
              >
                Community
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                Fostering long-term relationships that provide stable housing
                solutions and reliable income for landlords.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Our Impact (Data-Driven Stats) -->
      <section
        class="py-24 bg-primary text-on-primary px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop overflow-hidden relative"
      >
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full opacity-10"></div>
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto relative z-10">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
            <div>
              <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-xl mb-6">
                HomiFund Platform Foundations
              </h2>
              <p
                class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary-fixed mb-12 opacity-80"
              >
                Our ecosystem is rapidly expanding, bringing stability to
                thousands of rental agreements across the country.
              </p>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-headline-md font-headline-md mb-1">
                    Tenant Verification
                  </div>
                  <div class="font-label-md text-label-md opacity-70">
                    Verify identity, income, employment and references.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-headline-md font-headline-md mb-1">
                    Landlord Verification
                  </div>
                  <div class="font-label-md text-label-md opacity-70">
                    Verify ownership, compliance and legitimacy.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-headline-md font-headline-md mb-1">
                    HomiScore
                  </div>
                  <div class="font-label-md text-label-md opacity-70">
                    A reputation and trust framework for both tenants and
                    landlords.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="text-headline-md font-headline-md mb-1">
                    Property Matching
                  </div>
                  <div class="font-label-md text-label-md opacity-70">
                    Connect compatible tenants and landlords faster.
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden lg:block">
              <div
                class="glass-card bg-white/10 p-1 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-xl border-white/20"
              >
                <div
                  class="w-full h-[220px] sm:h-[320px] lg:h-[400px] bg-cover bg-center rounded-2xl"
                  data-alt="A sophisticated data visualization dashboard showing geographic distribution and market growth across a stylized map. The UI elements are sleek, with fine lines and subtle glows in primary blue and cyan. The aesthetic is high-tech, corporate, and precise, suggesting deep market penetration and institutional-grade data analytics. Light-mode compatible but with rich blue accents."
                  style="
                    background-image: url(&quot;https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBvWrrRNYELdu8fz0UsfoQwv5hXBxoy7d2npy8hNzHNoK9RD-jpf0NciNVL6s6GVo-IsjEgPWp3qeW1oxfJfanQxA7MuQpzD5IbE8dK-IPMclBuvK64yr5XECYwx_WJ5YHFh11-OWbKpS5ad1wcAbyHi8zSV6BUsgMmdUM__eUuOf7cis4BUpxRxKMDajRm903q4y3PDWCevjK8p4RSaIGcgtHThEwDi1IZglHMWuqOnckVkG_juAeLFdVh0hSPcbNYwWbuUFgtJu7c&quot;);
                  "
                ></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Call to Action -->
      <section class="py-32 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop text-center">
        <div
          class="max-w-container-max mx-auto bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-[32px] p-12 md:p-24 shadow-sm border border-outline-variant relative overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary-container rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl"
          ></div>
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-64 h-64 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl"
          ></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-xl text-primary mb-6">
              Ready to join the ecosystem?
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-10">
              Whether you're looking for your next home or managing a rental
              portfolio, trust starts here.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
              <button
                class="px-10 py-4 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-xl font-bold font-label-md text-label-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-95"
              >
                Get Started
              </button>
              <button
                class="px-10 py-4 border-2 border-primary text-primary rounded-xl font-bold font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-primary/5 transition-all active:scale-95"
              >
                View Pricing
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <!-- Footer -->
    <script>
      // Micro-interaction for core value cards
      document.querySelectorAll(".group").forEach((card) => {
        card.addEventListener("mouseenter", () => {
          card.style.transform = "translateY(-4px)";
          card.style.boxShadow = "0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 35, 111, 0.05)";
        });
        card.addEventListener("mouseleave", () => {
          card.style.transform = "translateY(0)";
          card.style.boxShadow = "none";
        });
      });
    </script>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
